WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.473
Raffles have not lost their relevance in the world of sales.

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:05.567
We all remember the classic slips of paper we were given in 

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:08.699
school to determine who was going to speak first or who was going 

00:00:08.699 --> 00:00:12.117
to choose the most talented ball player during physical education class.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.960
The origin of raffles dates back to the Renaissance, 

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:15.781
with Francis I, 

00:00:15.781 --> 00:00:16.602
French monarch, 

00:00:16.602 --> 00:00:19.476
who launched a very unusual competition in those years, 

00:00:19.476 --> 00:00:20.195
called Blanc, 

00:00:20.195 --> 00:00:23.480
and used it to pay the costs of the continuous wars of the time.

00:00:23.481 --> 00:00:23.872
Raffles, 

00:00:23.872 --> 00:00:26.355
over the years and with the arrival of new technologies, 

00:00:26.355 --> 00:00:29.577
have been improving and becoming more attractive on a professional level, 

00:00:29.577 --> 00:00:31.624
especially because they are a tactic that does 

00:00:31.624 --> 00:00:33.844
not require a very strong investment to sell more, 

00:00:33.844 --> 00:00:36.762
get the attention of new buyers and retain those you already have. 

00:00:36.762 --> 00:00:38.373
So far everything sounds incredible, 

00:00:38.373 --> 00:00:39.070
but be careful, 

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:40.028
without a clear plan, 

00:00:40.028 --> 00:00:42.031
this activity can become a nightmare for you. 

00:00:42.031 --> 00:00:45.210
There will always be those who are dissatisfied who will think that Juan 

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:48.563
Pérez did not have to win or that he did it because he was someone's friend.

00:00:48.563 --> 00:00:49.411
To avoid this, 

00:00:49.411 --> 00:00:52.875
you must be clear about the process of selecting the winner, 

00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:56.395
have the necessary tools to complete each activity with ease, 

00:00:56.395 --> 00:00:58.439
and share with participants all the 

00:00:58.439 --> 00:01:00.995
bases that will be used to select the winner.
